mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Need to shape the report?] --> Q1{Related records WITH or WITHOUT a child?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| XF[Cross filter]
  Q1 -->|No, just field values| FF[Field filter plus logic]
  Need --> Q2{Calculate per row or per group?}
  Q2 -->|Each record| RLF[Row-level formula]
  Q2 -->|Group or grand total| SF[Summary formula]
  Need --> Q3{Categorize values without a new object field?}
  Q3 -->|This report only| Bkt[Bucket column]
  Q3 -->|Reuse on many reports and lists| Obj[Object formula field instead]
